    "text": "\u00deis synt \u00fea land gem\u00e6ro \u00e6t Boclande & \u00e6t Welingtune.\n\u00c6rest uppan dune \u00e6t Achangran of Achangran adune on Sandford landgem\u00e6re, \u00feonne adune an \u00fea\nOf Cytelwylle andlang streames o\u00fe Tan.\nAdune andlang Tan streames o\u00fe Bradanford.\n\u00deanon andlang streames o\u00fe Herpo\u00feford.\n\u00deanon on \u00feeod herpo\u00f0 o\u00fe \u00fea estas.\n\u00deanon on land gemere o\u00fe Stanford.\n\u00deanon upp on Fiduc andlang landgem\u00e6res swa upp on M\u00e6r broc o\u00fe Byrnan hris.\n\u00deanon on \u00f0eod herpo\u00f0.\nSwa eft on Achangran.\n\u00deis synt \u00fea land gem\u00e6ro to Lidgerd.\n\u00c6rest on Linlege.\nOf Linlege uppon strem to Costanforda.\nOf Cottanforda upon strem to Gosforda.\nOf Gosford uppon strem to Stanforda.\nOf Stanforda on Fasingafeld.\nOf Fasingafelde.\nOn Pytt apuldre.\nOf Pytt apuldre on \u00e6st, Of \u00e6ste adun cousled to Readanclife, of Readanclife to Ruwanbeorge, of\nOf Ludanwille to Fricanfenne.\nOf Fricanfenne uppon streme.\nTo Gattibricge.\nOf Gattibrige to Wibbanwille.\nUppon an sl\u00e6d to Holan wege.\nOf Holanwege uppon sl\u00e6d to Bacganbeorge.\nOf Bacganbeorge to Wynestane.\nOf \u00feam stane to Ruwanbeorge.\nOf \u00feam beorge to Cwichemhamme.\nOf \u00f0am hamme to Collelade.\nOf Collislade.\nAdune on strem to Horspadesforda.\nOf \u00feam forda uppon str\u00e6m to Oxenagete.\nOf \u00feam gete to Motlege.\nOf Motlege on Fideroces torre.\nOf Fideroces torre to Frecan\u00f0orne.\nOf Frecan\u00f0orne on Snoccanmere.\nOf Snoccanmere on Stangedelfe.\nOn Hreod alras.\nOf Hreod alron on Tideford.\nOf \u00feam forda adune on strem to Cunecanforda.\nOf Cunecanforda on Cincgesget.\nOf Cincgesgete on Suran apuldran.\nOf Suran apuldran oth hit cymth eft on Linlege.",
